<title>USA: Scudder has no comment on Zurich Insurance Group.</title>
<headline>Scudder has no comment on Zurich Insurance Group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scudder, Stevens &amp; Clark declined comment on published reports that it was near a deal to be acquired by Zurich Insurance Group.</p>
<p>Earier, Zurich Insurance Group also declined comment.</p>
<p>The published reports said the Swiss insurer was considering a deal worth $1.5 billion for the private U.S. money management firm.</p>
</text>
